<title>HONG KONG: Goldtron 1996 net returns to profit.</title>
<headline>Goldtron 1996 net returns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.8 gain    vs 4.7 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  18.38 gain  vs 6.41 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    2.47 profit vs 14.56 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     165.28	vs 90.27</p>
<p>    Company name		 Goldtron Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Goldtron is a maker of video cassettes.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of a 28.2 percent stake in Goldtronics Sdn Bhd reducing the group's interest to 49.3 percent as set out in an announcement made on December 30, 1996 and circular to shareholders dated January 24, 1997.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
